  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAB: Creating Networks, Consolidating Alliances:  Communication and Information for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Latin America Bureau (LAB) is an independant charitable organisation based in London providing news, analysis and information on Latin America, its people, politicsa dn society.  LAB exists to promote greater understandindd and awareness of the region through conducting in-depth research and publishing books, news articles and focused reports on the most critical issues facing the region.

The Strategic Communications Project of LAB aims to:
1. Increase the amount of news and information available on key development issues in the region.
2. Strengthen local organisations through increased information provision and sharing.
3. Encourage greater debate and collaboration between stakeholders by identifying common approaches and common goals.

CAFOD funding will support Aims 1 and 2</narrative>
  </description>
